    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a gray pan positioned on the bottom side and a blue book located to the right of the pan. For every pair of red scissors in the image, there is a pair of glasses to its right and a black camera to the right of the glasses, such that they are aligned horizontally. Additionally, the scissors are placed above the pan, and the camera is smaller than the book.",
